---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Reveal from '../components/Reveal.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/config';
---

<Base title="Changelog — OMO Manager" description="Release history and highlights for OMO Manager.">
  <div class="container-page py-12 sm:py-16">
    <Reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Release history</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Changelog.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-muted">Current stable version: {SITE.version}. v1.0.0 was the first public release; earlier development builds were not published.</p>
    </Reveal>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_300px] lg:items-start">
      <div class="min-w-0 space-y-6">
        <Reveal>
          <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8" id="v1-0-6">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">v1.0.6</h2>
              <a href={`${SITE.repo}/releases/tag/v1.0.6`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-brand2 hover:text-white">GitHub release ↗</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Patch release · stable</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Highlights</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
              <li>TUI menus now reserve metadata rows so the highlighted option stays visible near the bottom of the screen.</li>
              <li>Manage presets can edit nested <code>presets.&lt;name&gt;.agents.&lt;agent&gt;</code> definitions as well as direct ones.</li>
              <li>Adding an OpenCode section no longer breaks configs whose last property has a trailing JSONC line comment.</li>
              <li>Uninstall preserves empty PATH segments (which represent the current directory) during smart cleanup.</li>
              <li>Migration guidance now bootstraps with the remote installer for older installed CLIs.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Breaking changes</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">None. Configuration files are unchanged.</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Migration</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Run the one-line installer to update. No configuration migration is needed.</p>
          </article>
        </Reveal>

        <Reveal>
          <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8" id="v1-0-5">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">v1.0.5</h2>
              <a href={`${SITE.repo}/releases/tag/v1.0.5`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-brand2 hover:text-white">GitHub release ↗</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Patch release · stable</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Highlights</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
              <li><code>omo-model-slim upgrade</code> now fetches the current installer from <code>main</code>, so it can move to a newer release instead of reinstalling the pinned installed version.</li>
              <li>Uninstall still uses the bundled installer when available, so it works offline.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Breaking changes</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">None. Configuration files are unchanged.</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Migration</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Run the one-line installer once to bootstrap the new upgrade logic: <code>curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/garsetayusuf/omo-model-slim/main/install.sh | bash</code>. Afterwards <code>omo-model-slim upgrade</code> works normally.</p>
          </article>
        </Reveal>

        <Reveal>
          <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8" id="v1-0-4">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">v1.0.4</h2>
              <a href={`${SITE.repo}/releases/tag/v1.0.4`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-brand2 hover:text-white">GitHub release ↗</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Patch release · stable</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Highlights</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
              <li>Upgrade now compares installed and release versions first and reports "Already up to date" when nothing changes.</li>
              <li><code>OMO_FORCE=1 omo-model-slim upgrade</code> still performs a full reinstall with a fresh rollback copy.</li>
              <li>No unnecessary downloads or rollback copies when versions match.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Breaking changes</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">None. Configuration files are unchanged.</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Migration</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Run the one-line installer once, then <code>omo-model-slim upgrade</code> reports whether an update is needed.</p>
          </article>
        </Reveal>

        <Reveal>
          <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8" id="v1-0-3">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">v1.0.3</h2>
              <a href={`${SITE.repo}/releases/tag/v1.0.3`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-brand2 hover:text-white">GitHub release ↗</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Patch release · stable</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Highlights</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
              <li>Fixed literal <code>\033[0m</code> escape text leaking into colored installer output.</li>
              <li>All ANSI color sequences are now interpreted consistently in headers, steps, summaries, and errors.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Breaking changes</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">None. Configuration files are unchanged.</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Migration</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Run <code>omo-model-slim upgrade</code>. No configuration migration is needed.</p>
          </article>
        </Reveal>

        <Reveal>
          <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8" id="v1-0-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">v1.0.2</h2>
              <a href={`${SITE.repo}/releases/tag/v1.0.2`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-brand2 hover:text-white">GitHub release ↗</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Patch release · stable</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Highlights</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
              <li>Branded step-by-step output for install, upgrade, uninstall, and verify.</li>
              <li>Colors and icons automatically disabled for non-TTY output, <code>NO_COLOR</code>, or <code>OMO_COLOR=0</code>.</li>
              <li>Checksum details are now summarized; use <code>OMO_VERBOSE=1</code> for per-file output.</li>
              <li>No functional change to configuration handling or the interactive menu.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Breaking changes</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">None. Configuration files are unchanged.</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Migration</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Run <code>omo-model-slim upgrade</code>. No configuration migration is needed.</p>
          </article>
        </Reveal>

        <Reveal>
          <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8" id="v1-0-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">v1.0.1</h2>
              <a href={`${SITE.repo}/releases/tag/v1.0.1`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-brand2 hover:text-white">GitHub release ↗</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Patch release · stable</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Highlights</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
              <li>Fixed blank pages caused by reveal wrappers that never hydrated: content now renders even without JavaScript.</li>
              <li>Added a persistent dark/light theme toggle that is reachable at every viewport width, including a matching terminal palette.</li>
              <li>Added <code>omo-model-slim upgrade</code> (aliases <code>update</code>, <code>install</code>) and <code>omo-model-slim uninstall</code>.</li>
              <li>Refreshed the FAQ around the core feature set and improved desktop release layout.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Breaking changes</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">None. Configuration files are unchanged.</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Migration</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Run <code>omo-model-slim upgrade</code> or the one-line installer. No configuration migration is needed.</p>
          </article>
        </Reveal>

        <Reveal>
          <article class="surface p-6 sm:p-8" id="v1-0-0">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">v1.0.0</h2>
              <a href={`${SITE.repo}/releases/tag/v1.0.0`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sm text-brand2 hover:text-white">GitHub release ↗</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Initial public release · stable</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Highlights</h3>
            <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">
              <li>Interactive, arrow-key terminal menu with searchable model lists and no numeric shortcuts.</li>
              <li>Schema-aware Slim editing: direct preset agents, nested agents, <code>extends</code> inheritance, root overrides, and <code>inheritModelFrom</code>.</li>
              <li>Ordered fallback chains and object model entries are preserved, including inline variants.</li>
              <li>OpenCode provider, custom model, MCP, and default-model management with comment-preserving atomic writes.</li>
              <li>Automatic timestamped backups, dry-run previews, verification, doctor checks, and one-step restore.</li>
              <li>Version-pinned installer with SHA-256 verification, rollback support, and no <code>sudo</code>.</li>
              <li>Astro documentation site with a browser-only xterm.js playground and responsive layouts.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Breaking changes</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">None. This was the first public release.</p>

            <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand2">Migration</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">No migration was required. The CLI discovered existing configuration automatically and never touched <code>omo-model</code>.</p>
          </article>
        </Reveal>
      </div>

      <aside class="space-y-4 lg:sticky lg:top-24" aria-label="Release information">
        <div class="surface p-5">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">Verify a release</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Every release publishes a <code>SHA256SUMS</code> file generated in CI. The installer checks it before writing anything.</p>
          <a href={`${SITE.repo}/releases`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm text-brand2 hover:text-white">All releases ↗</a>
        </div>
        <div class="surface p-5">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">Support matrix</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted">
            <li>✓ macOS (Intel &amp; Apple Silicon)</li>
            <li>✓ Linux (Ubuntu, Debian, Fedora)</li>
            <li>✓ Python 3.10, 3.12, 3.13</li>
            <li>△ WSL 2 — manual verification required</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="surface p-5">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">Versioning</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Stable releases use semantic versioning. Patch releases keep configuration compatibility; breaking changes require a minor or major version.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
